---
import DotGridIcon from './DotGridIcon.astro';
---

<section class="px-6 py-8 sm:py-12">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 mb-6">
    <DotGridIcon seed="about-me" />
    <h2 class="text-[28px] text-[#343844] font-normal leading-[1.2]">About</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
    <p class="text-[15px] text-[#5c6168] leading-[1.6]">
      I'm a product designer based in the San Francisco Bay Area, currently at CareMessage, where I design healthcare software for underserved communities. Before that, I spent three years at Plexuss building tools that connect students with colleges.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[15px] text-[#5c6168] leading-[1.6]">
      I care about making complex systems feel simple, and lately that's meant pairing design with AI tools like Claude Code to move faster from idea to shipped product.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
